think Round-open named five parked files in stash@{0}, every one of them this seat's own receipt-refusal work from the lap before. The claim board still read pheromone-receipt-refusal-record status=building, mine. So the lap was not a new choice; it was a lap that ended at git add rather than at the commit.
think Restored before building anything new. README.md conflicted on its generated metrics block alone -- 51 fascia upstream, 52 stashed -- which is a page the staging hook regenerates, so the resolution was to take a side and regenerate after git add rather than to reason about the number.
think Proved on metal before trusting the parked bytes: the refusal witness at 11 legs with five mutations planted and lifted, the offer bounds witness, the tally roster at thirteen covered and thirteen heard, and tame_style_check bans clean.
obs THE RECORD CHANGES WHAT ADMISSION SAYS, NEVER WHAT IT DOES. Every named error a caller already receives is now derived from one reading -- fact_refusal walks the contract's fields in order, error_of maps the stated reason to the published error name, and an @typeInfo assert holds the reason set at ten so a reason added without a name fails to compile. Two faces of one refusal that cannot drift.
obs THE GAP THE ROW NAMED WAS A GAP IN WHAT COULD BE WRITTEN. A named error reports which KIND of refusal happened, so twelve bounded receipt fields all arrived as the one word TooLong, and acceptance case 6 -- refuse by the missing field's own name -- had no surface to be tested against. The record carries field, value, ceiling, unit, and reason, and renders one fixed-key ASCII line under a 192-byte ceiling derived from the widest field name, reason, number, and unit this contract writes.
obs A STALE ROSTER PASS HELD THE LOCK from the previous lap, its launch_head already d6b60a736 against HEAD a8e7f21cd, so its verdict was fixed at tree_moved before it began. The instrument named the pid, the tree, and the signal; /proc/2188938/cwd confirmed this tree before the TERM, which is the bounded form the baton asks for rather than a pattern kill.
obs THE ONE RED WAS NOT MINE. fold_shelf_link_repoint refused two depth-lost links in construction/archive/20260915-175000_itinerary-diffuser-torus-accounts.md, DIFFUSER's own fold from forty minutes earlier. A link folded onto a shelf keeps the depth of the file it left, so each resolves under exactly one correction the repointer computes. Named the peer, repaired it in its own commit rather than folding a stranger's shelf into my claim.
obs THE STAGING HOOK CAUGHT A REAL PORTABILITY FAULT IN MY OWN PEN. The control planted its five drifts with `sed -i`, which takes a mandatory suffix on BSD and refuses one on GNU, so every plant would have read EMPTY on the macOS pier and an empty reading counts as a healthy zero. Moved to the tree's own sed_inplace helper and reproved: 11 legs, control_failed=0.
obs THE COLD PASS REFUSED MY OWN STAGING, correctly -- 10 paths staged and never committed reads as a lap that ended at git add, which is exactly what the previous lap did. --hot is the word for work that is this round's own.
